# Scenario name
msgid "Training: Cruiser"
msgstr "Training: Cruiser"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Basic Training Course\n"
"\n"
"Objective: Destroy all enemy ships in the area.\n"
"\n"
"Description:\n"
"During this training you will learn to coordinate the actions of your crew "
"and destroy an Exuari training ground.\n"
"\n"
"Your ship is a Phobos light cruiser - the most common vessel in the navy.\n"
"\n"
"This is a short mission for inexperienced players."
msgstr "Basic Training Course\n\nObjective: Destroy all enemy ships in the area.\n\nDescription:\nDuring this training you will learn to coordinate the actions of your crew and destroy an Exuari training ground.\n\nYour ship is a Phobos light cruiser - the most common vessel in the navy.\n\nThis is a short mission for inexperienced players."

